+
+For an ordered pair (a,b), define F(a,b)=a^5+b^5, using ordinary integer
+arithmetic (so a negative base has a negative fifth power).  Four pairs L1,
+L2,R1,R2 must satisfy
+
+  F(L1) * F(L2) = F(R1) * F(R2).
+
