+  },
+  "all_passed": true
+}

codex
Implemented a native Track B Diophantine-completion generator based on the paper’s Section 2 parametrization and first-power invariant ([paper](https://arxiv.org/html/2104.09298v1)).

Deliverables:

- [gen_2104_09298.py](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2104.09298/gen_2104_09298.py)
- [selftest_report.json](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2104.09298/selftest_report.json)
